[32m+[m[32m/*[m
[32m+[m[32m# Add search indexes to documents table[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Overview[m
[32m+[m[32mAdds a GIN index on the `extracted_text` column using the `pg_trgm`[m
[32m+[m[32mextension to accelerate case-insensitive partial-word searches (ILIKE[m
[32m+[m[32mwith wildcards). Also adds a B-tree index on `category` and `type` to[m
[32m+[m[32mspeed up filter queries. These indexes do not change any existing RLS[m
[32m+[m[32mpolicies — they are purely performance improvements.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Changes[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Extensions[m
[32m+[m[32m- Enables `pg_trgm` (trigram matching) for fast fuzzy text search[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Indexes (all IF NOT EXISTS — safe to re-run)[m
[32m+[m[32m- `idx_documents_extracted_text_trgm` — GIN trigram index on[m
[32m+[m[32m  `extracted_text` for fast ILIKE '%query%' searches[m
[32m+[m[32m- `idx_documents_summary_trgm` — GIN trigram index on `summary`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `idx_documents_title_trgm` — GIN trigram index on `title`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `idx_documents_category` — B-tree index on `category` for filter queries[m
[32m+[m[32m- `idx_documents_type` — B-tree index on `type` for filter queries[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Security[m
[32m+[m[32m- No changes to RLS policies. Existing anon+authenticated CRUD policies[m
[32m+[m[32m  remain unchanged. Indexes are transparent to access control.[m
[32m+[m[32m*/[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS pg_trgm;[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_documents_extracted_text_trgm[m
[32m+[m[32m  ON documents USING gin (extracted_text gin_trgm_ops);[m
